Allow the BF16 copy-engine ring at world size 16.

Lifts the reviewed-size whitelist only. On turin's four switches it measured 0.88 ms against the island
kernel's 1.89 ms for 1024 x 7168 BF16, with byte-identical outputs across ranks. Compressed wire modes stay
out of reach of this recipe. Apply with `patch --fuzz=0 -d <site-packages> -p1`.

